# Telegram Anti-Dopamine - Blocked Comments Configuration
#
# IMPORTANT: This file exists in TWO locations:
#   1. Project root: blocked_comments.txt (EDIT THIS ONE)
#   2. TMessagesProj/src/main/assets/blocked_comments.txt (auto-copied before build)
#
# After editing this file, copy it to assets before building:
#   cp blocked_comments.txt TMessagesProj/src/main/assets/blocked_comments.txt
#
# Add channel names here (one per line) to block comments/discussions for those channels.
# You will still be able to read the channel posts, but won't be able to open comments.
# Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored.
# Empty lines are also ignored.
#
# Matching is case-insensitive and uses substring matching.
# For example, "News" will match "News Channel", "Daily News", etc.
#
# Examples:
# News Channel
# Commentary Channel
# Discussion Group
#
# Add your blocked comment channels below:
